## What to deliver

Build the corruptor up operation by operation until each `frames/<index>.png`
matches the brief: the same low, wide, green segmented body with a red-eyed head
and an amber charge stinger in every frame, the legs stepping through a steady
scuttle and the body bobbing ~1 px, all facing right on full transparency. Played
in a loop the frames must read as a leggy crawler scuttling in place — not the
data-worm. When you are satisfied, stop: the recorded per-frame action logs are
your finished submission.
